      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540555700478-4be289fbecef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl card-neo -rotate-6 hover:rotate-0 transition duration-300 z-10" alt="Spa Lavender">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-10 bg-rose-200 p-4 rounded-xl card-neo z-20 -rotate-3">
        <p class="font-bold text-sm">✨ 100% Natural Extract</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Highlight Grid -->
  <section class="bg-amber-100/60 py-20 border-y-4 border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-center mb-12">คอลเลกชันยอดนิยม</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-emerald-100 p-8 rounded-2xl card-neo">
          <div class="h-48 rounded-xl bg-cover bg-center mb-6 border-2 border-gray-800" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617897903246-719242758050?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');"></div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Lavender Relief</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">ผ่อนคลายความเหนื่อยล้า ช่วยให้การนอนหลับลึกและมีประสิทธิภาพ</p>
          <a href="services.html" class="font-bold text-green-900 underline">ดูรายละเอียด →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-100 p-8 rounded-2xl card-neo">
          <div class="h-48 rounded-xl bg-cover bg-center mb-6 border-2 border-gray-800" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512290900676-26c2a48f4134?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');"></div>
